      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Compound AX-77 demonstrated significant efficacy in reducing inflammation within the targeted patient population during Phase II. Patients generally reported subjective improvements within the first week of treatment. Adverse event profiles were minimal, primarily restricted to mild occurrences of nausea or headaches. Overall, the observed treatment efficacy was markedly superior when compared directly to the placebo control group.",
      "source": "target",
